		{
			dependencies: ["5DFDD2E878D3C9DA"]
			description: [
				"Tinkers' Construct tools are assembled from &eparts&f, and every material gives each part different stats and a different trait. They never break for good, and they take &emodifiers&f."
				""
				"You were handed &6Materials and You&f when you arrived. It, and the books that follow, are the real manual."
				""
				"&7Tetra reshapes a tool piece by piece; Tinkers builds one from a recipe of parts and then stacks modifiers on it. Use either. Use both."
			]
