			description: [
				"&eTinkers' Levelling&f: every Tinkers tool, bow, staff and armour piece earns experience as you use it, up to level 5."
				""
				"Each level adds a modifier slot - three upgrade slots, then an ability slot, then one more upgrade. A well-used pickaxe is worth more than a new one."
				""
				"The tooltip shows a tool's level and how far it is to the next. Broad tools take three times as long."
